			min-height: 50px;
			padding: 12px 14px;
			border: 1px solid #54636c;
			border-radius: 4px;
			background: #172127;
			color: #f4f6f7;
			font:
				400 19px/1.5 "Outfit",
				sans-serif;
		}
	}
}

